        202.92,
        516.46,
        202.92,
        516.46,
        245.02,
        152.91,
        245.02
      ],
      "text": "The undersigned is directed to say that the\nCouncil of Ministers as shown in Annexure 'A' have relinquished\ntheir respective offices with effect from the 31st December,\n1984."
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 9,
      "poly": [
        152.91,
        255.13,
        498.01,
        255.13,
        498.01,
        309.01,
        152.91,
        309.01
      ],
      "text": "2. Shri Rajiv Gandhi has been sworn-in as the Prime\nMinister by the President at 5-15 P.M. today, 31st December,\n1984, in the Rashtrapati Bhavan. Other Ministers sworn-in\nby the President at 5-15 P.M. today, the 31st December, 1984\nare shown at Annexure 'B'."
    },
